locity.","zh":"该模型假定小车以恒定速度运动。","note":"velocity · 速度， 速率； 迅速， 快速 · constant velocity","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-26:s429","en":"We gathered to commiserate with our friend after her audition.","zh":"试演结束后，我们聚在一起安慰失意的朋友。","note":"commiserate · 同情， 怜悯 · commiserate with","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-26:s430","en":"Loud construction work can interfere with lessons in nearby classrooms.","zh":"嘈杂的施工可能干扰附近教室的授课。","note":"interfere · 干涉， 干扰， 妨碍 · interfere with","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-26:s431","en":"The final paragraph manages to encapsulate the book's central argument.","zh":"最后一段成功概括了全书的核心论点。","note":"encapsulate · 装入胶囊； 压缩； 总结， 概述 · encapsulate an idea","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-26:s432","en":"The garden is a fitting tribute to the school's founder.","zh":"这座花园是对学校创始人恰如其分的纪念。","note":"fitting · 适合的；试穿；装置 · a fitting tribute","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-26:s433","en":"Some students find it difficult to tolerate noise while studying.","zh":"有些学生学习时难以忍受噪声。","note":"tolerate · 容忍， 宽容； 容许， 承认 · tolerate noise","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-26:s434","en":"Please stack the chairs against the wall after the meeting.","zh":"会议结束后，请把椅子叠放在墙边。","note":"stack · 把…叠成堆， 堆放于； 堆积， 堆起；整齐的一叠 · stack chairs","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-26:s435","en":"The findings underline the importance of reliable public transport.","zh":"这些发现突出了可靠公共交通的重要性。","note":"underline · 画线于…之下； 强调 · underline a point","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-26:s436","en":"Local artists resent having their work altered without consultation.","zh":"当地艺术家对作品未经商量就被改动感到不满。","note":"resent · 愤恨； 对…表示愤恨， 感到气愤 · resent interference","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-26:s437","en":"The mime entertained the crowd without speaking a single word.","zh":"哑剧演员一言不发地为人群表演助兴。","note":"mime · 模拟，模仿；哑剧表演； 哑剧演员 · a mime artist","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-26:s438","en":"The manager listened carefully rather than dismissing her as an underling.","zh":"经理仔细倾听，没有把她当作小下属而轻视。","note":"underling · 职位低的人， 下属 · treat someone as an underling","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-26:s439","en":"The museum displays letters written by a former member of parliament.","zh":"博物馆展出了一位前议员写的信件。","note":"parliament · 议会， 国会 · a member of parliament","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-26:s440","en":"The instructions were ambiguous, so we asked for an example.","zh":"说明含糊不清，所以我们要求给出一个例子。","note":"ambiguous · 含糊其辞的； 不明确的， 模棱两可的 · an ambiguous statement","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-26:s441","en":"Sunlight entered through a narrow crack in the wooden shutters.","zh":"阳光透过木百叶窗上的一道窄缝照了进来。","note":"crack · 破裂； 发出爆裂声； 重击； 崩溃， 瓦解；裂缝，缝隙；爆裂声 · a narrow crack","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-26:s442","en":"Use string to bind the loose branches into a bundle.","zh":"用绳子把散落的树枝捆成一束。","note":"bind · 捆绑， 系； 约束； 凝结 · bind together","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-26:s443","en":"She dropped an ice cube into the warm lemonade.","zh":"她往温柠檬水中放入了一块冰块。","note":"cube · 立方形； 立方 · an ice cube","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-26:s444","en":"I packed a crisp apple and some cheese for lunch.","zh":"我装了一个脆苹果和一些奶酪作午餐。","note":"crisp · 脆的；利落的 · a crisp apple","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-26:s445","en":"The biology textbook includes a diagram of a blood clot.","zh":"生物教材里有一张血凝块示意图。","note":"clot · 凝结成块；凝块 · a blood clot","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-26:s446","en":"The unusually mild winter allowed outdoor work to continue.","zh":"异常温和的冬季让户外工作得以继续。","note":"mild · 温柔的； 温和的； 轻微的 · a mild winter","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-26:s447","en":"The study examines the environmental impact of the new road.","zh":"这项研究考察新道路对环境的影响。","note":"impact · 影响， 作用； 冲击 · environmental impact","recordings":[]},{"id":"